ta Sharing & Third Parties"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We do not sell your personal data. We share data only with:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Paddle.com"}]," — our Merchant of Record, who processes all payments. Paddle operates as an independent data controller for billing data."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Firebase / Google"}]," — authentication and cloud infrastructure services."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Vercel"}]," — hosting and deployment infrastructure."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Email & support tools"}]," — to communicate with you and manage support tickets."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Legal & regulatory authorities"}]," — where required by applicable law or a valid court order."]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"All third-party processors are subject to data processing agreements and are required to implement appropriate safeguards."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"terms-section","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"7. International Data Transfers"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Some of our service providers are located outside the European Economic Area (EEA). Where data is transferred internationally, we ensure appropriate safeguards are in place — such as Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) approved by the European Commission — to protect your data to the same standard as within the EEA."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"terms-section","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"8. Data Retention"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We retain personal data only for as long as necessary for the purposes for which it was collected, or as required by law:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Account data:"}]," For the duration of your account plus 3 years after closure."]}],["$","li",null,{"child